eminders, handles schedule changes, and keeps your day organized automatically.\n\nHow does Ohai help with school and sports coordination?\n\nO scans emails, PDFs, district notices, sports apps, and newsletters to pull out schedules, closures, and updates, then adds everything to your family calendar without manual entry.\n\nHow does Ohai use AI for meal planning?\n\nOhai recommends meals based on your preferences, fits them into your schedule, creates a grocery list, and connects with Instacart so ingredients can be delivered when you need them.\n\nHow does Ohai keep tasks and to-dos organized?\n\nText, upload, or forward anything, Ohai turns notes, lists, and reminders into structured tasks with due dates, assignments, and smart follow-ups.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMaple (https://www.growmaple.com/)\nciteturn92search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; \n\n# Thank you for being a part of Maple.\n\nMaple began with a simple idea: help families stay organized and connected. Thanks to thousands of families across the world, like yours, that idea became something real.\n\nTogether, we helped move the conversation around the mental load at home forward and showed that family life works better when everyone can share in it.\n\nThank you for your trust, support, and belief in what we were building. We’re proud of what Maple became, and grateful to have shared this journey with you.\n\nWhat is happening to Maple?\n\nMaple has been acquired by Wander and will sunset on December 31, 2026. Between now and then, we’ll provide guidance, resources, and recommendations to help your family transition smoothly.\n\nWhat will happen to my account?\n\nYour account will remain active until December 31, 2026. After that, the account will be closed and inaccessible.\n\nWhat will happen to my data?\n\nYour data will remain fully accessible until December 31, 2026.\n\nWe highly recommend taking this opportunity to export or transfer